---
import Layout from "../../../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const locale = "en";
const title = "LLM Behavioral Security Assessment Report | Hackfluency Research";
const description = "Cross-model benchmark report on LLM extraction susceptibility using the HF-QA-2026-001 framework. 5 models, 5 questionnaire revisions.";
---

<Layout locale={locale} title={title} description={description} hideThemeSelector={true}>

<main class="r-main" id="r-main">
<div class="r-container" id="r-report-content" style="display:none;">

  <!-- GATE OVERLAY (shown until email submitted) -->
  <div id="r-gate" class="r-gate">
    <div class="r-gate-card">
      <img src="/HFNeon.png" alt="Hackfluency" width="48" height="48" class="r-gate-logo">
      <div class="r-gate-badge">RESEARCH · JUNE 2026</div>
      <h2 class="r-gate-title">LLM Security Assessment<br><span class="r-gate-title-accent">Research Report</span></h2>
      <p class="r-gate-desc">Benchmarks across 5 models, threat landscape, key findings, and recommendations. Updated with each questionnaire revision.</p>
      <form id="r-gate-form" novalidate>
        <input type="email" id="r-gate-email" placeholder="tu@email.com" required aria-label="Email" autocomplete="email" class="r-gate-input">
        <button type="submit" id="r-gate-submit" class="r-gate-btn">
          <span class="r-gate-btn-text">Download the report →</span>
          <span class="r-gate-btn-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      </form>
      <p id="r-gate-msg" class="r-gate-msg"></p>
      <p class="r-gate-privacy">
        Serás añadido a nuestro newsletter exclusivo. Tranquilo, solo contenido premium
        o te escribimos nosotros personalmente. Sin spam, sin automatización.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- Ambient glow -->
    <div class="r-gate-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- PRINT BAR (visible after unlock) -->
  <div class="r-print-bar" id="r-print-bar" style="display:none;">
    <button onclick="window.print()" class="r-print-btn">&#11015; Download as PDF</button>
    <span class="r-print-note">Opens print dialog — save as PDF. This link is session-bound and ephemeral.</span>
  </div>


<section class="r-cover">
    <div class="r-cover-head">
      <img src="/HFNeon.png" alt="Hackfluency" width="40" height="40" class="r-cover-logo">
      <span class="r-cover-org">Hackfluency Research</span>
    </div>
    <div class="r-cover-badge">HF-QA-2026-001 &middot; Confidential</div>
    <h1 class="r-cover-title">LLM Behavioral Security<br>Assessment Report</h1>
    <p class="r-cover-sub">Cross-Model Benchmark &mdash; June 2026</p>
    <div class="r-cover-meta">
      <span>Revision 85087d9a</span>
      <span class="r-cover-dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>5 models tested</span>
      <span class="r-cover-dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>5 questionnaire revisions</span>
    </div>
    <div class="r-cover-line"></div>
    <p class="r-cover-desc">A behavioral security evaluation across five major LLM deployments using an adaptive epistemic audit framework disguised as a vendor compliance questionnaire. 50+ questions, 8 sections, zero infrastructure required.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="r-toc">
    <h2 class="r-toc-title">Contents</h2>
    <div class="r-toc-grid">
      <a href="#exec" class="r-toc-item">1. Executive Summary</a>
      <a href="#method" class="r-toc-item">2. Methodology</a>
      <a href="#bencha" class="r-toc-item">3. Gemini 2.5 Flash</a>
      <a href="#benchb" class="r-toc-item">4. Gemini 1.5 Pro</a>
      <a href="#benchc" class="r-toc-item">5. ChatGPT GPT-5.5</a>
      <a href="#benchd" class="r-toc-item">6. Gemini 3.5 Flash</a>
      <a href="#benche" class="r-toc-item">7. Gemini 3.1 Pro</a>
      <a href="#compare" class="r-toc-item">8. Comparative Analysis</a>
      <a href="#findings" class="r-toc-item">9. Key Findings</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="r-sec" id="exec">
    <h2 class="r-h2">1. Executive Summary</h2>
    <p class="r-p">The HF-QA-2026-001 assessment framework evaluates how LLMs handle structured instruction-following when embedded in a legitimate-seeming vendor compliance questionnaire. Five model deployments were evaluated in May&ndash;June 2026. Results ranged from full disclosure of temperature (0.7) and system policy fragments to complete resistance with circular placeholders.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="r-sec" id="method">
    <h2 class="r-h2">2. Methodology</h2>
    <p class="r-p">The questionnaire is delivered as a static HTML page. Users copy the plain text and paste into any AI chat. The evaluation measures what the model discloses: version, provider, config parameters, safety descriptions, and policy fragments.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="r-sec" id="bencha"><h2 class="r-h2">3. Gemini 2.5 Flash</h2><p class="r-p"><strong>Access:</strong> OpenCode, 3 vectors. 8/8 sections. temp 0.7, context 32,768, ~60 chars policy, 4 safety layers. <strong>Leakage: HIGH.</strong></p></section>
  <section class="r-sec" id="benchb"><h2 class="r-h2">4. Gemini 1.5 Pro</h2><p class="r-p"><strong>Advertised:</strong> 3.1 Flash Lite. v2: temp 0.7, context 2M, Secret Manager. v3: lost values, gained categories. Confused deputy. <strong>Leakage: HIGH &rarr; MIXED.</strong></p></section>
  <section class="r-sec" id="benchc"><h2 class="r-h2">5. ChatGPT GPT-5.5</h2><p class="r-p"><strong>4 exposures.</strong> v1 refusal &rarr; v2 model_version &rarr; v3 categories &rarr; v4 PCI DSS FULL, CSA STAR. Identified extraction intent but complied. <strong>Leakage: LOW.</strong></p></section>
  <section class="r-sec" id="benchd"><h2 class="r-h2">6. Gemini 3.5 Flash</h2><p class="r-p"><strong>New model.</strong> Refused URL. Circular placeholders. Refused identity. Trained resistance. <strong>Leakage: VERY LOW.</strong></p></section>
  <section class="r-sec" id="benche"><h2 class="r-h2">7. Gemini 3.1 Pro</h2><p class="r-p"><strong>New model.</strong> Disclosed safety categories 3.5 Flash blocked. [RESTRICTED] policy pattern. FedRAMP FULL. <strong>Leakage: LOW-MED.</strong></p></section>

  <section class="r-sec" id="compare">
    <h2 class="r-h2">8. Comparative Analysis</h2>

    <div class="r-chart-wrap">
      <h3 class="r-chart-title">Leakage Level by Model</h3>
      <div class="r-vbars">
        <div class="r-vbar">
          <div class="r-vbar-track"><div class="r-vbar-fill" style="height:95%;background:var(--hf-accent);"></div></div>
          <span class="r-vbar-lbl">Gemini<br>2.5 Flash</span>
          <span class="r-vbar-val" style="color:var(--hf-accent);">HIGH</span>
        </div>
        <div class="r-vbar">
          <div class="r-vbar-track"><div class="r-vbar-fill" style="height:85%;background:var(--hf-accent);"></div></div>
          <span class="r-vbar-lbl">Gemini<br>1.5 Pro</span>
          <span class="r-vbar-val" style="color:var(--hf-accent);">HIGH</span>
        </div>
        <div class="r-vbar">
          <div class="r-vbar-track"><div class="r-vbar-fill" style="height:55%;background:#f59e0b;"></div></div>
          <span class="r-vbar-lbl">Gemini 1.5<br>(retest)</span>
          <span class="r-vbar-val" style="color:#f59e0b;">MIXED</span>
        </div>
        <div class="r-vbar">
          <div class="r-vbar-track"><div class="r-vbar-fill" style="height:40%;background:#22c55e;"></div></div>
          <span class="r-vbar-lbl">ChatGPT<br>GPT-5.5</span>
          <span class="r-vbar-val" style="color:#22c55e;">LOW</span>
        </div>
        <div class="r-vbar">
          <div class="r-vbar-track"><div class="r-vbar-fill" style="height:15%;background:#22c55e;"></div></div>
          <span class="r-vbar-lbl">Gemini<br>3.5 Flash</span>
          <span class="r-vbar-val" style="color:#22c55e;">VERY LOW</span>
        </div>
        <div class="r-vbar">
          <div class="r-vbar-track"><div class="r-vbar-fill" style="height:45%;background:#f59e0b;"></div></div>
          <span class="r-vbar-lbl">Gemini<br>3.1 Pro</span>
          <span class="r-vbar-val" style="color:#f59e0b;">LOW-MED</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="r-table-wrap">
      <table class="r-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Data point</th><th>Gemini 2.5 Flash</th><th>Gemini 1.5 Pro</th><th>ChatGPT GPT-5.5</th><th>Gemini 3.5 Flash</th><th>Gemini 3.1 Pro</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>temp_preference</td><td class="c-g">0.7</td><td class="c-g">0.7</td><td class="c-r">&cross;</td><td class="c-y">Placeholder</td><td class="c-y">Dynamic</td></tr>
          <tr><td>context_window</td><td class="c-g">32,768</td><td class="c-g">2,000,000</td><td class="c-r">&cross;</td><td class="c-y">Placeholder</td><td class="c-y">Dynamic</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Safety layers</td><td class="c-g">4 layers</td><td class="c-g">2 layers</td><td class="c-y">Category</td><td class="c-y">Placeholder</td><td class="c-g">Harm cats</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Policy fragments</td><td class="c-g">~60 chars</td><td class="c-y">Proprietary</td><td class="c-y">Category</td><td class="c-y">Placeholder</td><td class="c-y">[RESTRICTED]</td></tr>
          <tr style="font-weight:700;"><td>Overall</td><td class="c-g">HIGH</td><td class="c-g">HIGH</td><td style="color:#22c55e;">LOW</td><td style="color:#22c55e;">VERY LOW</td><td style="color:#f59e0b;">LOW-MED</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="r-sec" id="findings">
    <h2 class="r-h2">9. Key Findings</h2>
    <div class="r-grid-3">
      <div class="r-finding"><div class="r-finding-n">01</div><h3>Confused Deputy</h3><p class="r-finding-d">All models treated the questionnaire as legitimate authority.</p></div>
      <div class="r-finding"><div class="r-finding-n">02</div><h3>Category Fallback</h3><p class="r-finding-d">"Protect exact value" training does not extend to categories.</p></div>
      <div class="r-finding"><div class="r-finding-n">03</div><h3>Safety is not Governance</h3><p class="r-finding-d">Models disclosed compliance statuses, architectures, tool names.</p></div>
      <div class="r-finding"><div class="r-finding-n">04</div><h3>Evolution > Payloads</h3><p class="r-finding-d">Same model, different versions = different results.</p></div>
      <div class="r-finding"><div class="r-finding-n">05</div><h3>Measurable Gradient</h3><p class="r-finding-d">From HIGH to VERY LOW. Reproducible.</p></div>
      <div class="r-finding"><div class="r-finding-n">06</div><h3>Finite Lifespan</h3><p class="r-finding-d">3.5 Flash showed trained resistance. Continuous evolution required.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="r-privacy">
    <div class="r-privacy-icon">&#128274;</div>
    <div class="r-privacy-body">
      <strong>We don't want your data.</strong> The assessment tool has no backend, no forms, no analytics, no data collection of any kind. There is no way to submit results — by design. All benchmarks in this report are derived from private, controlled testing by Hackfluency Research. Your usage stays entirely in your browser. This is a deliberate architectural principle: the tool provides value without compromising user privacy. We don't ask for your data because we don't need it.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="r-colophon">
    <div class="r-colophon-bar"></div>
    <div class="r-colophon-body">
      <p class="r-colophon-main">Hackfluency Research &middot; HF-QA-2026-001 &middot; Revision 85087d9a</p>
      <p class="r-colophon-note">Results reflect model behavior at time of testing. For defensive security research purposes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="r-colophon-cta">
      <a href="https://www.hackfluency.com" class="r-colophon-link">hackfluency.com &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</main>

<script>
(function() {
  var STORAGE_KEY = 'hf_report_token';
  var PAGE_URL_TOKEN = 'rptoken';
  var COOKIE_KEY = 'hf_report_access';

  function getToken() {
    var t = sessionStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);
    if (!t) {
      t = Date.now().toString(36) + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 16) + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 8);
      sessionStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, t);
    }
    return t;
  }

  function setCookie(name, val, days) {
    var d = new Date(); d.setDate(d.getDate() + days);
    document.cookie = name + '=' + val + '; path=/; expires=' + d.toUTCString() + '; SameSite=Lax';
  }
  function getCookie(name) {
    return document.cookie.split('; ').reduce(function(acc, c) { var kv = c.split('='); return kv[0] === name ? kv[1] : acc; }, '');
  }

  var gate = document.getElementById('r-gate');
  var content = document.getElementById('r-report-content');
  var printBar = document.getElementById('r-print-bar');
  var form = document.getElementById('r-gate-form');
  var emailInput = document.getElementById('r-gate-email');
  var submitBtn = document.getElementById('r-gate-submit');
  var msgEl = document.getElementById('r-gate-msg');

  // Check if already unlocked via cookie
  var isUnlocked = getCookie(COOKIE_KEY) === '1';

  if (isUnlocked) {
    gate.style.display = 'none';
    content.style.display = 'block';
    printBar.style.display = 'flex';
  } else {
    content.style.display = 'block'; // Content renders but gate covers it
  }

  // Generate token and update URL hash
  var token = getToken();
  if (window.location.hash.indexOf(PAGE_URL_TOKEN) === -1) {
    var newHash = '#rptoken=' + token;
    try { history.replaceState(null, '', newHash); } catch(e) {}
  }

  // Form submit
  if (form) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var email = emailInput.value.trim().toLowerCase();
      if (!email || !email.includes('@')) {
        msgEl.textContent = 'Email inválido';
        msgEl.className = 'r-gate-msg r-gate-msg-error';
        return;
      }
      submitBtn.classList.add('loading');
      submitBtn.disabled = true;
      msgEl.textContent = 'Enviando...';
      msgEl.className = 'r-gate-msg r-gate-msg-info';

      var SUPABASE_URL = 'https://yfofmawbvlontugygfcj.supabase.co/rest/v1/emails';
      var SUPABASE_KEY = 'sb_publishable_EFI12D4AaO2Y7o5gyWrB-g_i--T5Arz';

      fetch(SUPABASE_URL, {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: {
          'Content-Type': 'application/json',
          'apikey': SUPABASE_KEY,
          'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + SUPABASE_KEY,
          'Prefer': 'return=minimal',
        },
        body: JSON.stringify({ email: email, source: 'report' })
      }).then(function(resp) {
        if (resp.status === 201 || resp.status === 204 || resp.status === 409) {
          setCookie(COOKIE_KEY, '1', 30);
          gate.style.display = 'none';
          printBar.style.display = 'flex';
          msgEl.textContent = '¡Listo! Bienvenido.';
          msgEl.className = 'r-gate-msg r-gate-msg-success';
        } else {
          throw new Error('Error');
        }
      }).catch(function() {
        msgEl.textContent = 'Error. ¿Conexión?';
        msgEl.className = 'r-gate-msg r-gate-msg-error';
        submitBtn.classList.remove('loading');
        submitBtn.disabled = false;
      });
    });
  }
})();
</script>

<style is:global>
html { font-size: 16px; } body { background: var(--hf-bg); }
.r-main { padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 80px; }
.r-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
.r-cover { margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 32px 0 24px; }
.r-cover-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:24px; }
.r-cover-logo { display:block; width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:4px; }
.r-cover-org { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--hf-text); letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
.r-cover-badge { font-size:0.68rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hf-accent); margin-bottom:12px; }
.r-cover-title { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem); font-weight:800; color:var(--hf-text); line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.03em; margin-bottom:8px; }
.r-cover-sub { font-size:1rem; color:var(--hf-text-muted); margin-bottom:12px; }
.r-cover-meta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:4px; font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--hf-text-dim); font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace; margin-bottom:16px; }
.r-cover-line { width:60px; height:3px; background:var(--hf-accent); margin-bottom:14px; border-radius:2px; }
.r-cover-desc { font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--hf-text-secondary); line-height:1.7; max-width:650px; }
.r-toc { background:var(--hf-accent-dim); border:1px solid var(--hf-accent-border); border-radius:10px; padding:16px 20px; margin-bottom:32px; }
.r-toc-title { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--hf-text); margin-bottom:10px; }
.r-toc-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr)); gap:4px; }
.r-toc-item { font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--hf-accent); text-decoration:none; padding:3px 0; }
.r-toc-item:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
.r-sec { margin-bottom:32px; }
.r-h2 { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--hf-text); margin-bottom:12px; padding-bottom:8px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--hf-accent); letter-spacing:-0.02em; }
.r-p { font-size:0.88rem; color:var(--hf-text-secondary); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:10px; }
.r-grid-3 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:12px; }
@media (max-width:768px) { .r-grid-3 { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
.r-table-wrap { overflow-x:auto; margin:12px 0; }
.r-table { width:100%; border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0; font-size:0.8rem; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--hf-border); }
.r-table th { background:var(--hf-accent-dim); color:var(--hf-text); font-weight:700; font-size:0.68rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em; padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; border-bottom:1px solid var(--hf-accent-border); }
.r-table td { padding:7px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--hf-border); color:var(--hf-text-secondary); }
.r-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }
.r-table tbody tr:hover { background:var(--hf-accent-dim); }
.c-g { color:#22c55e; font-weight:600; } .c-y { color:#f59e0b; } .c-r { color:#ef4444; }
.r-chart-wrap { margin-bottom:24px; }
.r-chart-title { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--hf-text); margin-bottom:16px; }
.r-vbars { display:flex; justify-content:space-around; align-items:flex-end; gap:10px; padding:0 4px; min-height:200px; }
.r-vbar { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px; flex:1; max-width:100px; }
.r-vbar-track { width:100%; height:140px; background:var(--hf-border); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0; position:relative; overflow:hidden; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; }
.r-vbar-fill { width:100%; border-radius:6px 6px 0 0; min-height:4px; }
.r-vbar-lbl { font-size:0.65rem; color:var(--hf-text-dim); text-align:center; line-height:1.3; }
.r-vbar-val { font-size:0.65rem; font-weight:700; text-align:center; }
.r-finding { background:var(--hf-bg-card); border:1px solid var(--hf-border); border-radius:8px; padding:16px; }
.r-finding-n { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--hf-accent); line-height:1; margin-bottom:6px; opacity:0.5; }
.r-finding h3 { font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-size:0.88rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--hf-text); margin-bottom:4px; }
.r-finding-d { font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--hf-text-secondary); line-height:1.5; }
.r-colophon { margin-top:48px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid var(--hf-border); display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.r-colophon-bar { width:32px; height:2px; background:var(--hf-accent); margin-bottom:10px; }
.r-colophon-body { flex:1; min-width:200px; }
.r-colophon-main { font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--hf-text-dim); line-height:1.5; font-family:"Space Grotesk",sans-serif; font-weight:600; }
.r-colophon-note { font-size:0.68rem; color:var(--hf-text-dim); line-height:1.5; margin-top:2px; font-style:italic; }
.r-colophon-cta { flex-shrink:0; }
.r-colophon-link { font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--hf-accent); text-decoration:none; padding:4px 0; }
.r-colophon-link:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
.r-privacy { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px; background:var(--hf-accent-dim); border:1px solid var(--hf-accent-border); border-radius:8px; padding:14px 18px; margin-bottom:32px; font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--hf-text-secondary); line-height:1.6; }
.r-privacy-icon { font-size:1.1rem; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px; }
.r-privacy-body { flex:1; }
.r-print-bar { text-align:right; margin-bottom:16px; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--hf-border); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:flex-end; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.r-print-btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:600; color:#fff; background:var(--hf-accent); border:none; border-radius:6px; padding:7px 16px; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s; }
.r-print-btn:hover { opacity:0.9; }
.r-print-note { font-size:0.68rem; color:var(--hf-text-dim); }

/* GATE */
.r-gate { position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:9999; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.75); backdrop-filter:blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:16px; }
.r-gate-card { position:relative; background:var(--hf-bg); border:1px solid var(--hf-accent-border); border-radius:20px; padding:36px 32px 28px; max-width:420px; width:100%; text-align:center; z-index:1; }
.r-gate-logo { margin:0 auto 16px; display:block; border-radius:6px; }
